source:
Narai and Ramsuko are apprentice magicians.
In order to gain the qualifications to become official magicians, the two
become apprentices to Majo, nicknamed Sloth.

Camellia, an adventurer who travels to various places such as mountains, fields, seas and rivers to collect materials;
Beryl, an aspiring magic machine engineer;
Inari, woman of a certain age who runs a farm on the outskirts of town;

Narai grows as he gets to know these women.
But a shadow creeps into Narai's daily life as he aspires to become a mage... and attacks the women around Narai.

What will be the outcome for the women and Narai?

